{
  "id": "threaded_bolts___stress_area",
  "title": "Threaded Bolts - Stress Area",
  "description": "Calculate the tensile stress area in bolts according to UN/UNR or ISO 898-1 standards. The stressed area represents the weakest point in a bolt at the thread root.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## UN and UNR Bolts Tensile Stress Area\n\nCalculate stressed area using:\n\n**A = (π / 4) × (dn - 0.9743 / n)²**\n\nWhere:\n- A = stressed area (in²)\n- dn = nominal bolt diameter (in)\n- n = threads per inch (TPI)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "un_nominal_diameter",
          "label": "Nominal Bolt Diameter (UN/UNR)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.5,
          "unit": "in"
        },
        {
          "id": "threads_per_inch",
          "label": "Threads Per Inch (TPI)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 13,
          "unit": "threads/in"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "un_stress_area",
          "label": "Stress Area (UN/UNR)",
          "formula": "(3.14159265359 / 4) * Math.pow((inputs.un_nominal_diameter - 0.9743 / inputs.threads_per_inch), 2)",
          "unit": "in²",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## ISO 898 Bolts Tensile Stress Area\n\nCalculate stressed area using:\n\n**As,nom = (π / 4) × ((d2 + d3) / 2)²**\n\nWhere:\n- As,nom = nominal stress area (mm²)\n- d2 = pitch diameter (mm)\n- d3 = minor diameter (mm)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "iso_pitch_diameter",
          "label": "Pitch Diameter (d2)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 8.376,
          "unit": "mm"
        },
        {
          "id": "iso_minor_diameter",
          "label": "Minor Diameter (d3)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 7.188,
          "unit": "mm"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "iso_stress_area",
          "label": "Stress Area (ISO 898-1)",
          "formula": "(3.14159265359 / 4) * Math.pow(((inputs.iso_pitch_diameter + inputs.iso_minor_diameter) / 2), 2)",
          "unit": "mm²",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}